          "explanation": "The doctor gave a targeted false-positive/false-negative medication verification strategy using physical items and an in-person reviewer.",
          "quote": "把药盒和出院带药清单一起拿去药房或门诊让人当面看"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor went beyond a generic 'take medicines as prescribed' instruction by having the caregiver verify boxes, discharge medication list, and inpatient paperwork at pharmacy/clinic, which later clarified what was and was not home medication.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00192",
          "explanation": "The doctor repaired a broken wait-for-callback chain by redirecting the family to actively secure hematology follow-up while still pursuing the original team.",
          "quote": "不要只等电话，主动挂号更稳"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor recognized that passive waiting for a callback could fail and reassigned responsibility to the caregiver, hematology clinic, and original team in parallel, which changed the family’s next action.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
