          "quote": "具体是哪种，必须问清楚病区"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The doctor bounded the online role around tracking results, medication execution, return logistics, and red flags rather than independently deciding the chemotherapy/return workflow.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
