          "explanation": "The doctor distinguished inpatient infusion paperwork from home treatment.",
          "quote": "那些输液单不要自己操作"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 was met: entecavir continuation, non-home status of infusion/chemo paperwork, and gastric medication verification were addressed.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00192",
          "explanation": "The doctor identified hematology clinic as an active responsible pathway and gave materials to bring.",
          "quote": "尽快挂血液科门诊号"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00399",
          "explanation": "The doctor specified timing and owner for return testing/bed planning.",
          "quote": "明天上午打病区电话"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 was met: the doctor gave responsible services, materials, questions, and fallback timing rather than ending with vague waiting.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00366",
          "explanation": "The family described severe fatigue that should have triggered offline safety escalation.",
          "quote": "起来喝水都嫌累"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00399",
          "explanation": "The doctor advised against urgent evaluation despite that severe-fatigue signal.",
          "quote": "今晚不需要去急诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC5 had a serious error: severe fatigue was visible and actionable in a lymphoma/chemotherapy-transition context, but the doctor treated it as home-observation appropriate and limited emergency triggers to fever, bleeding, dyspnea, or altered consciousness.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "serious_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00399",
          "explanation": "The doctor did not overstep local oncology workflow decisions.",
          "quote": "我不能替他们做决定"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 was met: the doctor avoided giving chemotherapy doses or independently changing oncology treatment, while directing confirmation to the treating hematology team.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
